          "weapon, which sheds light in a 30 ft. radius (dim light another 30 ft.) that you can "
          "activate/suppress as a bonus action. Once per day, when you hit with it, you can expend "
          "a charge (4 charges, regains 1d4 at dawn) to blind the target as a reaction unless it "
